{"strongs": "H6950", "word": "קָהַל", "translit": "qa.hal", "root": "קהל", "morph": "H:V", "pos": "verb denominative", "gloss": "assemble as a", "definition": "[ קָהַל ] verb denominative ( Gerber 107 f. ) assemble as a קָהָל ; — Niph`al Perfect 3 masculine plural נִקְהֲלוּ Esth 9:2 + 3 t.; Imperfect 3 masculine singular וַיִּקָּהֵל Exod 32:1 ; Jer 26:9 3 masculine plural וַיִּקָּֽהֲלוּ 2Sam 20:14 Qr ( Kt ויקלהו , compare HPS ), etc.; Infinitive construct הִקָּהֵל Num 17:7 ; Esth 8:11 Participle plural נִקְהָלִים Ezek 38:7 — assemble as a קָהָל : 1. a. for conflict or war 2Sam 20:14 ( Qr ; see above), Esth 8:11 ; Esth 9:2 ; Esth 9:15 ; Esth 9:16 ; Esth 9:18 with עַל person Ezek 38:7 , accusative of location Josh 22:12 ; Judg 20:1 . \\ \\ b. rebellion, with עַל person Num 16:3 ; Num 17:7 ; Num 20:2 ( P ), possibly also Exod 32:1 ( J ; most, unto Aaron). 2. for religious purposes: to erect tent of meeting, accusative of location Josh 18:1 ( P ); hear word of ׳ י , with אֶל location Lev 8:4 ( P ), ב location + אֶל person Jer 26:9 for festival, אֶל person 1Kgs 8:2 = 2Chr 5:3 לְ local 2Chr 20:26 . Hiph`il Perfect 2 masculine singular הִקְהַלְתָּ Ezek 38:13 , וְהִקְהַלְתָּ֫ Num 8:9 3 masculine plural הִקְהִילוּ Num 1:18 Imperfect 3 masculine singular יַקְהִיל Job 11:10 אָז יַקְהֵל 1Kgs 8:1 = יַקְהֵיל 2Chr 5:2 וַיַּקְהֵל Exod 35:1 + ( Qal Imperfect in i according to Ba NB p. 147 ); plural וַיַּקְהִלוּ Num 20:10 Imperative masculine singular הַקְהֵל Lev 8:3 +, etc.; Infinitive construct הַקְהִיל Num 10:7 — summon an assembly: 1. a. for judgment Job 11:10 . \\ \\ b. for war 1Kgs 12:21 = 2Chr 11:1 ; Ezek 38:13 . 2. for religious purposes: with accusative אֶתהַֿקָּהָל Num 10:7 , + אֶל location Num 20:10 , with accusative (כָּלֿ)הָעֵדָה Exod 35:1 ; Num 1:18 ; Num 8:9 ; Num 20:8 ( P ), + אל location Lev 8:3 ; Num 16:19 ( P ); with accusative הָעָם Deut 4:10 ; Deut 31:12 כָּליֿשׂראל 1Chr 13:5 ; 1Chr 15:3 elders of tribes Deut 31:28 , of Israel 1Kgs 8:1 = 2Chr 5:2 princes of Israel 1Chr 28:1 .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB7333')\">BDB7333</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H6950')\">H6950</entry> <entry onclick=\"sn('H7035')\">H7035</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB7332')\">BDB7332</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB7334')\">BDB7334</entry></div><p> [<bdbheb>קָהַל</bdbheb>] <b>verb denominative</b> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Gerber')\">Gerber<sup>107 f.</sup></lookup>) <highlightword>assemble as a</highlightword> <bdbheb>קָהָל</bdbheb>; — <div class=\"point\"><b>Niph`al</b> <highlight>Perfect</highlight> 3 masculine plural <bdbheb>נִקְהֲלוּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Esth 9:2\" b=\"17\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(17,9,2)\">Esth 9:2</ref> + 3 t.; <highlight>Imperfect</highlight> 3 masculine singular <bdbheb>וַיִּקָּהֵל</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 32:1\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(2,32,1)\">Exod 32:1</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 26:9\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(24,26,9)\">Jer 26:9</ref> 3 masculine plural <bdbheb>וַיִּקָּֽהֲלוּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Sam 20:14\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(10,20,14)\">2Sam 20:14</ref> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Qr')\"><reflink>Qr</reflink></lookup> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Kt')\"><reflink>Kt</reflink></lookup> <bdbheb>ויקלהו</bdbheb>, compare <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('HPS')\">HPS</lookup>), etc.; <highlight>Infinitive</highlight> construct <bdbheb>הִקָּהֵל</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Num 17:7\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(4,17,7)\">Num 17:7</ref>; <ref ref=\"Esth 8:11\" b=\"17\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(17,8,11)\">Esth 8:11</ref> <highlight>Participle</highlight> plural <bdbheb>נִקְהָלִים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezek 38:7\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"38\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"38\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(26,38,7)\">Ezek 38:7</ref> — <highlight>assemble as a</highlight> <bdbheb>קָהָל</bdbheb>: </div><div class=\"point\"><b>1. a.</b> <highlightword>for conflict or war</highlightword> <ref ref=\"2Sam 20:14\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(10,20,14)\">2Sam 20:14</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Qr')\"><reflink>Qr</reflink></lookup>; see above), <ref ref=\"Esth 8:11\" b=\"17\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(17,8,11)\">Esth 8:11</ref>; <ref ref=\"Esth 9:2\" b=\"17\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(17,9,2)\">Esth 9:2</ref>; <ref ref=\"Esth 9:15\" b=\"17\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(17,9,15)\">Esth 9:15</ref>; <ref ref=\"Esth 9:16\" b=\"17\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(17,9,16)\">Esth 9:16</ref>; <ref ref=\"Esth 9:18\" b=\"17\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(17,9,18)\">Esth 9:18</ref> with <bdbheb>עַל</bdbheb> person <ref ref=\"Ezek 38:7\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"38\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"38\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(26,38,7)\">Ezek 38:7</ref>, accusative of location <ref ref=\"Josh 22:12\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(6,22,12)\">Josh 22:12</ref>; <ref ref=\"Judg 20:1\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(7,20,1)\">Judg 20:1</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> rebellion, with <bdbheb>עַל</bdbheb> person <ref ref=\"Num 16:3\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(4,16,3)\">Num 16:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 17:7\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(4,17,7)\">Num 17:7</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 20:2\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(4,20,2)\">Num 20:2</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>), possibly also <ref ref=\"Exod 32:1\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(2,32,1)\">Exod 32:1</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup>; most, <highlight>unto</highlight> Aaron). </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> for religious purposes: to erect tent of meeting, accusative of location <ref ref=\"Josh 18:1\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(6,18,1)\">Josh 18:1</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>); hear word of <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>י</bdbheb>, with <bdbheb>אֶל</bdbheb> location <ref ref=\"Lev 8:4\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(3,8,4)\">Lev 8:4</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>), <bdbheb>ב</bdbheb> location + <bdbheb>אֶל</bdbheb> person <ref ref=\"Jer 26:9\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(24,26,9)\">Jer 26:9</ref> for festival, <bdbheb>אֶל</bdbheb> person <ref ref=\"1Kgs 8:2\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(11,8,2)\">1Kgs 8:2</ref> = <ref ref=\"2Chr 5:3\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(14,5,3)\">2Chr 5:3</ref> <bdbheb>לְ</bdbheb> local <ref ref=\"2Chr 20:26\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"26\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"26\" onclick=\"bcv(14,20,26)\">2Chr 20:26</ref>. <b>Hiph`il</b> <highlight>Perfect</highlight> 2 masculine singular <bdbheb>הִקְהַלְתָּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezek 38:13\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"38\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"38\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(26,38,13)\">Ezek 38:13</ref>, <bdbheb>וְהִקְהַלְתָּ֫</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Num 8:9\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(4,8,9)\">Num 8:9</ref> 3 masculine plural <bdbheb>הִקְהִילוּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Num 1:18\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(4,1,18)\">Num 1:18</ref> <highlight>Imperfect</highlight> 3 masculine singular <bdbheb>יַקְהִיל</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 11:10\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(18,11,10)\">Job 11:10</ref> <bdbheb>אָז יַקְהֵל</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Kgs 8:1\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(11,8,1)\">1Kgs 8:1</ref> = <bdbheb>יַקְהֵיל</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Chr 5:2\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(14,5,2)\">2Chr 5:2</ref> <bdbheb>וַיַּקְהֵל</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 35:1\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"35\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"35\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(2,35,1)\">Exod 35:1</ref> + (<b>Qal</b> <highlight>Imperfect</highlight> in <highlight>i</highlight> according to <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Ba')\">Ba<sup>NB p. 147</sup></lookup>); plural <bdbheb>וַיַּקְהִלוּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Num 20:10\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(4,20,10)\">Num 20:10</ref> <highlight>Imperative</highlight> masculine singular <bdbheb>הַקְהֵל</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Lev 8:3\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(3,8,3)\">Lev 8:3</ref> +, etc.; <highlight>Infinitive construct</highlight> <bdbheb>הַקְהִיל</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Num 10:7\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(4,10,7)\">Num 10:7</ref> — <highlight>summon an assembly:</highlight> </div><div class=\"point\"><b>1. a.</b> <highlightword>for judgment</highlightword> <ref ref=\"Job 11:10\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(18,11,10)\">Job 11:10</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> for war <ref ref=\"1Kgs 12:21\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(11,12,21)\">1Kgs 12:21</ref> = <ref ref=\"2Chr 11:1\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(14,11,1)\">2Chr 11:1</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 38:13\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"38\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"38\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(26,38,13)\">Ezek 38:13</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> for <highlight>religious purposes:</highlight> with accusative <bdbheb>אֶתהַֿקָּהָל</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Num 10:7\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(4,10,7)\">Num 10:7</ref>, + <bdbheb>אֶל</bdbheb> location <ref ref=\"Num 20:10\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(4,20,10)\">Num 20:10</ref>, with accusative <bdbheb>(כָּלֿ)הָעֵדָה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 35:1\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"35\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"35\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(2,35,1)\">Exod 35:1</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 1:18\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(4,1,18)\">Num 1:18</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 8:9\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(4,8,9)\">Num 8:9</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 20:8\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(4,20,8)\">Num 20:8</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>), + <bdbheb>אל</bdbheb> location <ref ref=\"Lev 8:3\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(3,8,3)\">Lev 8:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 16:19\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(4,16,19)\">Num 16:19</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>); with accusative <bdbheb>הָעָם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Deut 4:10\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(5,4,10)\">Deut 4:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 31:12\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(5,31,12)\">Deut 31:12</ref> <bdbheb>כָּליֿשׂראל</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Chr 13:5\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(13,13,5)\">1Chr 13:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Chr 15:3\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(13,15,3)\">1Chr 15:3</ref> elders of tribes <ref ref=\"Deut 31:28\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"28\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"28\" onclick=\"bcv(5,31,28)\">Deut 31:28</ref>, of Israel <ref ref=\"1Kgs 8:1\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd